{"4570390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LIMICORE", "steam_appid": 4570390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a laborer for a shadowy corporation, Gregory finds himself caught in the middle of a sinister mission. With a coworker that has gone absent, he begins to uncover the mysteries surrounding their disappearance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Corporation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a dystopian society, the LIMICORE corporation was established to be the new governing body. It operates under extreme confidentiality, and its employees are limited to only basic knowledge required to perform their duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simultaneous Realities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIMICORE features a reality-swapping mechanic that enables you to traverse the world, solve environmental puzzles and piece clues together. Discover the connection to bypass obstacles, manipulate machinery and transfer items between each reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570390/extras/8011ad315635931f5b3d2baf898bb754.poster.avif?t=1788124567\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570390/extras/8011ad315635931f5b3d2baf898bb754.webm?t=1788124567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570390/extras/8011ad315635931f5b3d2baf898bb754.mp4?t=1788124567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a laborer for a shadowy corporation, Gregory finds himself caught in the middle of a sinister mission. With a coworker that has gone absent, he begins to uncover the mysteries surrounding their disappearance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Corporation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a dystopian society, the LIMICORE corporation was established to be the new governing body. It operates under extreme confidentiality, and its employees are limited to only basic knowledge required to perform their duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simultaneous Realities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIMICORE features a reality-swapping mechanic that enables you to traverse the world, solve environmental puzzles and piece clues together. Discover the connection to bypass obstacles, manipulate machinery and transfer items between each reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570390/extras/8011ad315635931f5b3d2baf898bb754.poster.avif?t=1788124567\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570390/extras/8011ad315635931f5b3d2baf898bb754.webm?t=1788124567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570390/extras/8011ad315635931f5b3d2baf898bb754.mp4?t=1788124567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "LIMICORE is a dark and narratively driven experience containing uncovered mysteries. Traverse the world through various realities and solve engaging puzzles to discover the truth behind the organization's objectives.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570390/5ba6a172fc47a1fc5a55824ecbd23c3eca707e41/header.jpg?t=1788124567", "capsule_image": "https:/